			"color":"#222",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Guide: [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n**Paper:** [TripoSplat on arXiv](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16355)\n\n## Model Links (for Local Users)\n\nModel: [VAST-AI/TripoSplat](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat)\n\n**background_removal**\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [triposplat_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/diffusion_models/triposplat_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**clip_vision**\n\n- [dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/clip_vision/dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors)\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 background_removal/\n│   │   └── birefnet.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── triposplat_fp16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 clip_vision/\n│   │   └── dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       ├── triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"
